Clean: 2 findings kept on purpose (listed below). StyleBro's fixes leave these: renaming by hand breaks what the check protects. Check those uses first, or suppress or baseline them (https://bisforboman.github.io/stylebro/getting-started/#findings-kept-on-purpose).
  src/protobuf-net.Grpc/Internal/ContractOperation.cs(264,38): BRO1311 Rename tuple element 'category' to 'Category'. Kept: another element of the same tuple type keeps its name, and a tuple type's elements are renamed together (first: 'type': the name is in disabled #if code, which can't be checked).
